        why: ['The Moon is in **Karka** (its own sign); Jupiter is in **Tula**, the 4th sign from the Moon: a **kendra from the Moon**.', 'Jupiter is neither debilitated nor combust.', 'The book adds conditions for the full yoga: a benefic link to Jupiter (here Venus in Mesha aspects Tula), and a Moon that is neither debilitated nor combust (here it is in its own sign, far from the Sun).', 'Gaja-kesari means "elephant and lion": wealth, fame, learning and the strength to overcome opponents.'],
