        why: ['Every kendra holds at least one planet: Mars in the 1st, the Moon in the 4th, Jupiter in the 7th, the Sun and Mercury in the 10th.', 'All four kendras occupied: **Chatus-saagara** ("four oceans") yoga.', 'The kendras are the pillars of the chart, so planets in all four give a well-supported life.', 'The book says it destroys many arishtas and gives wealth and high status.'],
